bird.json and pointing-up.json are Google's Noto animated emoji (U+1F426 and
U+261D), fetched from https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/latest/.

They are licensed CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

They are here as real-world Lottie: hand-written fixtures use a layer or two,
while these use the shape groups, masks and interpolation that actual stickers
do — and they are the documents that first showed ThorVG reaching host imports
beyond heap growth.
